Package: salt-agent-ubus
Version: 0.2.0-1
Depends: rpcd, uhttpd-mod-ubus
Section: admin
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Christian Prior-Mamulyan <cprior@gmail.com>
Description: Salt agent for OpenWrt ubus JSON-RPC transport
 Creates a salt-agent system user with rpcd login and installs ACL
 rules granting scoped access to UCI, network, and system ubus
 objects via the JSON-RPC API.
